            '| `state` | Meaning |',
            '| `disabled` | The subsystem is not configured to run.',
            ('It has no obligation, contributes no condition, and its block carries only '
             'the members marked *always*. |'),
            ('| `starting` | The subsystem is configured or required and still '
             'initialising: the runtime has not yet brought it up, and the [startup '
