             'runtime-health/v4 *Heartbeat Mapping* gives the source of every field.'),
            ('**Migration.** The runtime node heartbeat family is defined, as it stood, '
             'in [gateway-api/v1.md](v1.md), which is frozen and which the gateway claims.'),
            'The `critical` status, the tokens above and steps 1, 9 and 11 exist only here.',
            ("A gateway implements and claims this version's heartbeat rules before any "
             'runtime emits a runtime-health/v4 heartbeat; until then the runtime emits '
