            'Emitted beside them; it decides no severity by itself. |',
            ("| `firmware_liveness_device_expired` | `critical` | A supervised device's "
             'last liveness publication is at least the expiry window old. |'),
            ('| `firmware_liveness_over_capacity` | `degraded` | More devices are '
             'supervised than the scheduler supports. |'),
            ('| `firmware_liveness_stopped` | `critical` | The liveness loop ended after '
             'starting, not by orderly shutdown. |'),
            ('| `firmware_liveness_tick_failures` | `degraded` | Liveness ticks are '
             'failing while supervision is still inside its window. |'),
            ('| `firmware_liveness_tick_stale` | `critical` | No liveness tick has '
             'succeeded within the expiry window. |'),
            ("| `safety_zone_activation_refused` | `degraded` | An eligible zone's "
             'profile was refused at activation, so the zone is not protected. |'),
            ('| `safety_zone_active_unprotected` | `degraded` | A zone the device has '
             'undertaken to protect reports `unprotected`, or its sensor is not reporting. |'),
            ('| `safety_zone_trip_unresolved` | `critical` | A commanded protective trip '
